    "summary": {
        "en": [
            "This collection contains digitized works by William Morgan Shuster, an American lawyer and diplomat who served as the treasurer-general of Persia in the early 20th century. The collection includes his writings and photographs related to his experiences in Persia, particularly during the Constitutional Revolution."
        ]
    },
